// N-BEATS (ml_finance/nbeats.odin) against a torch (float64) transcription of the
// authors' reference code (ElementAI/N-BEATS models/nbeats.py): a generic model (input
// 8, horizon 3, 2 blocks of 2 layers of 6) and an interpretable one (input 8, horizon 4,
// trend stack of 2 shared blocks of width 5 with degree 2, seasonality stack of 2 shared
// blocks of width 7 with 1 harmonic), weights from the LCG in both, 5 windows of an LCG
// series: forecasts, MSE and every parameter gradient (incl. the shared blocks'), then
// 10 Adam steps (lr 0.01): the last loss and the forecasts.

